const pnrm=s=>' '+String(s).toLowerCase().normalize('NFD').replace(/[̀-ͯ]/g,'').replace(/\b(celular|ceular|galaxy|iphone|xiaomi|moto|honor)\b/g,' ').replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g,' ').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim()+' ';
function cuotaIni(){const c=cat(),m=model();if(!m||!c.models)return null;let best=null;
  for(const r of PLANES.items){if(!Array.isArray(r)||r[0]!==c.brand||!(r[2]>0))continue;const N=pnrm(r[1]);let win=null,wl=0;
    for(const x of c.models)for(const al of x.name.split(' / ')){const k=pnrm(al);if(k.trim()&&N.includes(k)&&k.length>wl){wl=k.length;win=x.name}}
    if(win===m.name&&(!best||r[2]<best.v))best={v:r[2],op:r[3]||''}}
  return best}
const ciBox=()=>window.plCI?plCI(true):'';
const ciHtml=()=>window.plCI?plCI(false):'';
